#: Module.cpp:130
msgctxt ""
"The backend is trying to figure out what drivers are suitable for the users "
"system"
msgid "Collecting information about your system"
msgstr "Prikupljanje informacija o vašem sustavu"

#: Module.cpp:220 DriverManager.cpp:248
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The package system could not be initialized, your configuration may be "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"Sustav paketa se ne može pokrenuti, vaše podešavanje je možda slomljeno"

#: Module.cpp:232
msgctxt "The backend replied with a error"
msgid ""
"Something went terribly wrong. Please hit the 'Refresh Driver List' button"
msgstr ""
"Nešto je pošlo jako pogrešno. Pritisnite 'Osvježi popis upravljačkih "
"programa' tipku"

